    "text": "By Grant Green ,\n4 hours ago SIOUX FALLS, S.D. (Dakota News Now) - As the city of Sioux Falls grows by the thousands so quickly, the city is working on ways to support this growth. Now that the new state penitentiary is expected to be built in the Sioux Falls area, law enforcement officials have called on the state to give them the financial support they need. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
